# 3D Printer to 2D Pen Plotter Mod

Turn any 3D printer or CNC machine into a precision 2D pen plotter / drawing robot.

## Safety and responsible use

This project is intended for educational, research, and experimental purposes only.
It is not intended for production, safety-critical, unlawful, harmful, or irresponsible use.

Users are solely responsible for reviewing and testing generated G-code before running it,
checking all hardware safety limits, supervising machine operation, and complying with
all applicable laws and regulations. Do not use this software for dangerous,
unauthorized, harmful, or unsafe purposes.

The author does not endorse, approve, or accept responsibility for any damage, injury,
loss, misuse, or other consequences resulting from the use or misuse of this software,
its generated output, or connected equipment. The software is provided "AS IS" without
warranty of any kind.

## Download

Download the latest standalone Windows build (`.zip`) from the [Releases](https://github.com/projectDesignerr/3D-Printer-to-2D-Plotter-Mod/releases) tab.

